'''Akane Tounji''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

